# Secrets and local runtime configuration must never enter a build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.aws
**/.ssh
**/*secret*
**/*credential*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx

# Repository and local development state.
.git
**/.git
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/coverage
**/dist
**/.runtime
**/.ipynb_checkpoints
tmp
src/lp
